meta {
  name: note-categories
  seq: 99
}

docs {
  Categories that notes are filed under (`NoteCategoryResource`, `/api/note-categories`), one list per
  entity type shared by every torg (TRUCK: Maintenance, Challan, Others to start with, seeded by V97).
  Reading is open to every notes role; adding, renaming/reordering and deleting is VAHN_ADMIN only.
  Names are unique per entity type ignoring case and repeated spaces (409 otherwise).
}
